# Probe 348/4c (lowering): the named tail take(p: y: int: 6) -- 62 exits 7; today the stage refusal of slice 345.
Point:
    int: x 1
    int: y 2
end: Point
fn: take (Point: p; int: q 2) int
    return: p\y * 10 + q
end: take
int: code 7
if: take(p: y: int: 6) != 62
    code: 81
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
